  <jpcrp030000-asr_E04323-000:NotesRegardingCostsOfBusinessStructureImprovementTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;※６　事業構造改善費用&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　婚礼印刷業における不採算資材の整理や営業所閉鎖に伴う費用を、事業構造改善費用として特別損失に計上しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp030000-asr_E04323-000:NotesRegardingCostsOfBusinessStructureImprovementTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingReclassificationAdjustmentsAndTaxEffectsRelatingToOtherComprehensiveIncomeTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;※１　その他の包括利益に係る組替調整額及び税効果額&lt;/p&gt;
